<speak>Please use Singapore dollars as the currency for this transaction. The monetary amount I'm specifying for this transaction is 25,000. The pen is fine, thanks. It's one of those ordinary ballpoint pens that somehow writes better than the nice ones people give as presents. I keep it with this notebook so I don't have to hunt for it. My assistant would laugh if she saw how particular I've become about a pen and a folder. At the office, she used to be the person keeping all of that in order for me.</speak>